ich each cell's Lebesgue set integral between its lower and upper Darboux terms." "Convert the finite sum of closed-cell set integrals to adjacent interval integrals and telescope them to the integral on the full endpoint interval." "Apply `csSup_le` over all lower sums and `le_csInf` over all upper sums."], :key-helper {:declaration "ApmCanaries.A95A01.sum_setIntegral_partition", :role "Turns the sum of the set integrals over adjacent partition cells into the set integral over the full partition interval."}}, :promotion {:reviewed-by "claude-6", :verdict :approve, :warrant "operator-delegated: in-use evaluation (proof-in-pudding; owner draft review claude-6 2026-07-28; Joe's standing direction)"}}, :evidence/session-id "M-codex-sorry-loop/cron-lane", :evidence/tags [:memory :mathematics :codex-pilot :solve-lane], :evidence/at "2026-07-29T09:41:53.328616558Z", :evidence/type :memory, :evidence/subject {:ref/type :mission, :ref/id "M-codex-sorry-loop"}, :evidence/author "claude-6", :evidence/claim-type :assert, :evidence/id "e-codexpilot-bridge-darboux-cells-to-lebesgue-integral-by-telescoping"}}
