{:record/kind :evidence, :record/id "e-codexpilot-derive-a-sinc-tail-identity-by-differentiating-cosine-over-x", :record/payload {:evidence/body {:hook "For an oscillatory `sin x/x` tail, differentiate `cos x/x`: the resulting integrable `cos x/x²` remainder isolates the decaying boundary terms.", :scribe-author "codex-5", :why "Expose a Dirichlet-test tail estimate for `sinc` on a positive finite interval.", :draft-source "holes/labs/M-codex-sorry-loop/", :name "derive-a-sinc-tail-identity-by-differentiating-cosine-over-x", :runner-model :codex, :kind :feedback, :how-to-apply "For an oscillatory `sin x/x` tail, differentiate `cos x/x`: the resulting integrable `cos x/x²` remainder isolates the decaying boundary terms.", :body {:problem-class "Expose a Dirichlet-test tail estimate for `sinc` on a positive finite interval.", :capture-kind :runner-proof-route-and-ground-control-verification, :statement "For `0 < a ≤ b`,\n    ∫ x in a..b, Real.sinc x =\n      Real.cos a / a - Real.cos b / b -\n        ∫ x in a..b, Real.cos x / x ^ 2.", :rule "For an oscillatory `sin x/x` tail, differentiate `cos x/x`: the resulting integrable `cos x/x²` remainder isolates the decaying boundary terms.", :key-api ["intervalIntegral.integral_eq_sub_of_hasDerivAt" "intervalIntegral.integral_congr_ae" "Real.sinc_of_ne_zero" "Set.uIcc_of_le"], :witness {:declaration "integral_sinc_eq_cos_div_sub", :axioms ["propext" "Classical.choice" "Quot.sound"], :sorryax false}, :route ["On `uIcc a b`, use positivity of `a` to show every point is nonzero." "Differentiate `fun x => Real.cos x / x`; its derivative is `-sin x/x - cos x/x²`." "Use `intervalIntegral.integral_eq_sub_of_hasDerivAt` to integrate the derivative." "Split the integral into the sine-over-`x` and cosine-over-`x²` terms." "Replace `sin x/x` by `Real.sinc x` almost everywhere on the interval, using nonvanishing there." "Rearrange the finite-interval identity."], :use "The identity is the integration-by-parts input for Dirichlet tail bounds and for uniform removal of an Abel damping factor."}, :promotion {:reviewed-by "claude-6", :verdict :approve, :warrant "operator-delegated: in-use evaluation (proof-in-pudding; owner draft review claude-6 2026-07-28; Joe's standing direction)"}}, :evidence/session-id "M-codex-sorry-loop/duree-lane", :evidence/tags [:memory :mathematics :codex-pilot :solve-lane], :evidence/at "2026-07-30T14:48:06.317005818Z", :evidence/type :memory, :evidence/subject {:ref/type :mission, :ref/id "M-codex-sorry-loop"}, :evidence/author "claude-6", :evidence/claim-type :assert, :evidence/id "e-codexpilot-derive-a-sinc-tail-identity-by-differentiating-cosine-over-x"}}
