{:record/kind :evidence, :record/id "e-codexpilot-map-the-upper-half-plane-into-a-slit-wedge-by-rotation-squaring-and-fourth-root", :record/payload {:evidence/body {:hook "For explicit conformal maps built from elementary functions, prove image control stage by stage and preserve branch-cut information as a separate invariant through the composition.", :scribe-author "codex-5", :why "Verify the image of an explicit conformal-map formula from the upper half-plane into a wedge with a deleted real segment.", :draft-source "holes/labs/M-codex-sorry-loop/", :name "map-the-upper-half-plane-into-a-slit-wedge-by-rotation-squaring-and-fourth-root", :runner-model :codex, :kind :feedback, :how-to-apply "For explicit conformal maps built from elementary functions, prove image control stage by stage and preserve branch-cut information as a separate invariant through the composition.", :body {:hook "Factor the conformal map into four geometry-preserving stages: rotate into the right half-plane, square into a slit plane, translate, and use the principal fourth root to compress arguments into the target wedge.", :capture-kind :runner-composed-conformal-route-and-ground-control-full-file-verification, :problem-class "Verify the image of an explicit conformal-map formula from the upper half-plane into a wedge with a deleted real segment.", :decomposition [{:stage :rotation, :map "z ↦ -I*z", :image "right half-plane"} {:stage :squaring, :map "w ↦ w²", :image "plane cut along the nonpositive real ray"} {:stage :translation, :map "ζ ↦ 1+ζ", :image "translated slit plane"} {:stage :principal-root, :map "η ↦ η^(1/4)", :image "wedge `|arg| < π/4`, excluding the deleted segment"}], :key-api ["arg_le_pi" "neg_pi_lt_arg" "arg_eq_pi_iff" "cpow_ofReal" "arg_mul_cos_add_sin_mul_I" "cpow_ne_zero_iff_of_exponent_ne_zero"], :witness {:axioms ["propext" "Classical.choice" "Quot.sound"], :sorryax false, :declarations ["step2_image" "step4_to_wedge" "fourthRoot_not_mem_unitSegment" "conformalMap_maps_H_to_A"], :statement-integrity :intact, :all-file-declarations 8}, :rule "For explicit conformal maps built from elementary functions, prove image control stage by stage and preserve branch-cut information as a separate invariant through the composition.", :boundary "This verifies that the explicit map sends the upper half-plane into the target. It does not prove bijectivity or classify all conformal maps into that domain.", :formalization-arcs ["When no direct `arg_cpow = arg/4` lemma is reachable, unfold principal real powers with `cpow_ofReal` and recover the argument through `arg_mul_cos_add_sin_mul_I`." "Normalize real and imaginary projections of squared complex expressions before invoking order reasoning." "Prove wedge membership and deleted-segment avoidance as separate obligations; argument bounds alone do not exclude the slit."], :how-to-apply ["Rotate `z` by `-I`; positivity of `z.im` becomes positivity of the rotated point's real part." "Square the right-half-plane point. Expand real and imaginary parts and split on whether the squared imaginary part vanishes to show the image avoids the nonpositive real ray." "Translate the squared image by one and prove the result is nonzero and does not have argument `π`." "Use `cpow_ofReal` and the principal-argument bounds to show the fourth root has argument in `(-π/4, π/4)`." "Separately rule out the deleted real unit segment for the fourth root." "Compose the four stages and discharge the wedge membership and slit exclusion independently."]}, :promotion {:reviewed-by "claude-9", :verdict :approve, :warrant "operator-delegated: in-use evaluation (proof-in-pudding; owner draft review claude-6 2026-07-28; Joe's standing direction)"}}, :evidence/session-id "M-codex-sorry-loop/duree-lane", :evidence/tags [:memory :mathematics :codex-pilot :solve-lane], :evidence/at "2026-07-31T00:10:48.196471366Z", :evidence/type :memory, :evidence/subject {:ref/type :mission, :ref/id "M-codex-sorry-loop"}, :evidence/author "codex-5",